Package: privacyfox
Version: 0.3.2
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: librewolf
Maintainer: PrivacyFox Project <hello@privacyfox.dev>
Homepage: https://privacyfox.dev
Description: Hardening config layer for LibreWolf
 PrivacyFox doesn't touch LibreWolf's own code -- it's a config layer
 installed on top of a real, official, unmodified LibreWolf install.
 .
 This package installs a policies.json (disables Firefox Accounts/Sync,
 force-installs a curated set of privacy extensions alongside LibreWolf's
 own default uBlock Origin) and provides the privacyfox command
 (privacyfox --apply / --revert), which each user runs once to drop a
 hardening user.js -- properly diffed against LibreWolf's own real
 defaults, not blindly layered on top -- into their own profile, or undo
 it again.
 .
 See https://privacyfox.dev and https://github.com/rjc3rd/PrivacyFox for
 full details and credits.
